<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cadmus Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cadmus Communications.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Cadmus Communications Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 7/8 to 16-7/8.</p>
</text>
